Lieutenant!

00:13:56.869 --> 00:14:00.066
Well, as long as you understand,
that's fine, then.

00:14:00.105 --> 00:14:02.835
And you know,
I don't recognize you two.

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:03.864
Are you new recruits?

00:14:03.909 --> 00:14:04.898
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:04.944 --> 00:14:07.071
We've just joined the Special Mobile
Investigation Force.

00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:09.439
Hmm...

00:14:10.216 --> 00:14:12.684
You've got a pretty cute face,
don't you?

00:14:12.718 --> 00:14:13.912
What's your name?

00:14:13.953 --> 00:14:15.420
Shindo!

00:14:15.454 --> 00:14:17.922
Okay, Shindo, I see.

00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:20.789
I like your kind of face.

00:14:20.826 --> 00:14:23.420
Maybe I should scout you
for my division...

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:29.423
You taste how I thought you would,
the way I like it.

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:30.833
Lieutenant Suzuka!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:33.566
What are you doing?
We're going already!

00:14:33.606 --> 00:14:34.595
Okay!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.200
See ya, Shindo!

00:14:37.243 --> 00:14:39.473
If things don't go well with the Special
Mobile Investigation Force,

00:14:39.511 --> 00:14:41.240
then come over to my division.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:44.147
You'd be really welcome.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.850
What was with her?

00:14:46.886 --> 00:14:48.649
W-Who knows?

00:14:49.455 --> 00:14:52.253
That was probably Suzuka
from the second division.

00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:53.588
The second division?

00:14:53.626 --> 00:14:55.025
The Special Security Section
of the Special Mobile

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.687
Investigation Force's
second division,

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:58.390
also known as "SpecSec".

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.022
SpecSec?

00:15:00.065 --> 00:15:01.999
Was there a section like that in the
Special Mobile Force?

00:15:02.034 --> 00:15:03.433
Didn't you know?

00:15:03.469 --> 00:15:05.494
It's the special branch.

00:15:05.537 --> 00:15:07.095
It means that they're
a special branch

00:15:07.139 --> 00:15:08.436
of the Special Mobile
Investigation Force.

00:15:08.474 --> 00:15:10.374
A special branch of the Special Mobile
Investigation Force?

00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:11.933
What's that all about?

00:15:11.977 --> 00:15:14.673
Well, I don't know the details
about it, either.

00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:16.180
I heard that that Suzuka girl

00:15:16.215 --> 00:15:18.683
has been a part of that division
since the beginning.

00:15:18.717 --> 00:15:21.709
The story is that she was made
a lieutenant at age 18

00:15:21.754 --> 00:15:22.914
all of the sudden.

00:15:22.955 --> 00:15:25.423
A lieutenant at age 18!?

00:15:25.457 --> 00:15:28.392
That's a promotion faster than any
career officer has ever had, isn't it?

00:15:28.427 --> 00:15:32.158
Well, it looks like the second division
is a collection of elite officers.

00:15:32.197 --> 00:15:35.257
Nothing to do with us normals.

00:15:35.301 --> 00:15:38.361
Huh, so that girl is quite
the wonder, is she?

00:15:38.404 --> 00:15:39.701
That's what it sounds like.

00:15:39.738 --> 00:15:43.003
I've heard that she's made
quite a few arrests.

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:46.409
But it probably would be best
if you didn't get too involved

00:15:46.445 --> 00:15:47.503
with the guys in the SpecSec.

00:15:47.546 --> 00:15:48.570
Huh?

00:15:48.614 --> 00:15:51.105
You see, there are rumors
that they're a dangerous unit.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.516
Dangerous? How so?

00:15:53.552 --> 00:15:56.988
I've heard that their gear
is kind of unusual.

00:15:57.022 --> 00:15:58.182
Unusual?

00:15:58.223 --> 00:16:00.783
It looks like they use swords
in addition to their guns.

00:16:00.826 --> 00:16:02.020
Swords!?

00:16:04.129 --> 00:16:07.098
And it looks like they kill people
with those swords, too.

00:16:07.132 --> 00:16:08.963
They slash people!?

00:16:09.001 --> 00:16:10.229
That's got to be a lie.

00:16:10.269 --> 00:16:11.736
It's true, I tell you!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.761
Look, there was that case in Gotanda
where the guy

00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:15.467
was slashing at people as they
went by, right?

00:16:15.507 --> 00:16:19.341
Officially, they say that a member
of the SpecSec sniped him.

00:16:19.378 --> 00:16:23.712
But one of the guys in my year rushed
to the scene and saw...

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.940
...the guys from the SpecSec

00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:27.646
were carrying swords
covered in blood.

00:16:28.787 --> 00:16:29.947
And on top of that,

00:16:29.989 --> 00:16:32.856
the rumors say that they're chasing
things that aren't human.

00:16:38.297 --> 00:16:40.424
What's wrong, Kureha?

00:16:40.466 --> 00:16:43.367
You've been looking at that guy
for a while now.

00:16:43.402 --> 00:16:46.530
When I licked him,

00:16:46.572 --> 00:16:49.040
he tasted like something
from the other side.

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:50.098
What?

00:16:50.142 --> 00:16:51.473
That kid did?

00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:54.501
Hey...

00:16:54.546 --> 00:16:56.605
Hey, Shindo!

00:16:56.648 --> 00:17:00.482
What's up? It looks
like you're dreaming.

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:02.510
No, it's nothing.

00:17:02.554 --> 00:17:04.749
Come on, get a hold
of yourself, man.

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:07.414
Whoa!

00:17:07.459 --> 00:17:10.257
W-What the hell!?
Another earthquake!?

00:17:10.295 --> 00:17:11.284
This is a big one!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.922
Haven't there been
a lot recently!?

00:17:12.965 --> 00:17:15.399
Damn it!
What the hell is going on!?

00:17:20.739 --> 00:17:23.708
It looks like another gate
has opened up.

00:17:23.742 --> 00:17:26.472
I wonder...
if it's Number Twelve.

00:17:26.512 --> 00:17:29.037
We're going to be busy, too,
aren't we?

00:17:29.081 --> 00:17:30.946
Yeah. 'Hunting'.

00:17:37.923 --> 00:17:40.050
Things are going great today!

00:17:40.092 --> 00:17:42.959
That's because things
are so messed up these days

00:17:42.995 --> 00:17:45.122
with the scattered body part murders
and the earthquakes and stuff.

00:17:45.164 --> 00:17:47.394
Everyone just wants to be happy.

00:17:47.433 --> 00:17:49.424
Well, for the time being,

00:17:49.468 --> 00:17:51.436
I guess that makes us
happy delivery guys.

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:53.062
Just kidding!

00:17:55.941 --> 00:17:57.932
Hey, what are you looking at?

00:17:57.976 --> 00:18:00.911
What's with him?
He's not wearing any clothes.

00:18:00.946 --> 00:18:02.436
Maybe he's high?

00:18:02.481 --> 00:18:05.279
Sorry, but we're done
for today.

00:18:05.984 --> 00:18:08.578
H-Hey, what's that?

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:09.951
A... head?

00:18:09.988 --> 00:18:11.956
T-This guy's bad news!

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.252
He's completely gone
in the head!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:28.740
Hello, this is the Traffic Division.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:29.508
Yes, that's right.
Hello, this is the Traffic Division.

00:18:29.508 --> 00:18:30.167
Yes, that's right.

00:18:30.209 --> 00:18:32.268
Yes, you'll be transferred
to the person in charge of that case.

00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:33.778
Please stay on the line.
Please wait.

00:18:33.812 --> 00:18:35.473
It's all right,
please remain calm.

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:39.016
Hey, Shindo!

00:18:39.051 --> 00:18:41.884
Hanazono!
Jeez, don't scare me like that!

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.785
What are you doing?

00:18:43.822 --> 00:18:45.949
You already peeking in
on the newcomers?

00:18:45.991 --> 00:18:48.289
Don't be stupid!

00:18:48.327 --> 00:18:51.125
I just thought I'd check
on something.

00:18:51.163 --> 00:18:52.152
On what?

00:18:52.197 --> 00:18:54.427
No, it's nothing important.

00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:56.331
By the by,
were there any cute ones?

00:18:56.368 --> 00:18:57.357
Hey, rookies!

00:18:57.402 --> 00:18:58.391
Y-Yes, sir!

00:18:58.437 --> 00:19:00.769
Oh crap... We're going to get
yelled at again...

00:19:00.806 --> 00:19:03.570
We're heading out, the second team
has been ordered to move out!

00:19:03.609 --> 00:19:04.769
What?

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.677
There's been a murder!
Don't forget your barf bag!

00:19:07.713 --> 00:19:08.839
Barf bag?

00:19:08.881 --> 00:19:11.611
Well, it sounds like they've been
chopped up like pieces of meat.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:13.515
It's the scattered body part case!

00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:22.354
Okay, please back away,
please back away.

00:19:22.394 --> 00:19:25.727
I haven't seen a scene this bad
in a while...

00:19:30.402 --> 00:19:33.599
What's the murder weapon?
This isn't the work of one person.

00:19:33.639 --> 00:19:37.006
It's possible that it was a fight
between two drug dealers.

00:19:37.042 --> 00:19:38.509
Or it could have been
a couple of addicts

00:19:38.544 --> 00:19:40.603
that had the murder weapons
and they went nuts...

00:19:43.248 --> 00:19:46.274
Hey! Take care
of that evidence!

00:19:46.952 --> 00:19:49.682
These look like
they were torn open...

00:19:49.721 --> 00:19:52.019
They didn't use any kind
of blade...

00:19:52.057 --> 00:19:53.524
Then an explosive, perhaps?

00:19:53.559 --> 00:19:55.686
No. If they had used
an explosive,

00:19:55.727 --> 00:19:58.628
then there would be signs
of burning somewhere.

00:19:58.664 --> 00:19:59.824
That's true.

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:02.834
And on top of that, it seems like
the scars on the corpses

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:05.428
were left behind
by some kind of carnivore.

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:07.335
A carnivore...

00:20:07.372 --> 00:20:10.967
Hey, Shindo, I'm amazed
you're okay with all of this.

00:20:12.244 --> 00:20:13.472
It's similar.

00:20:13.512 --> 00:20:18.347
To back then... when my dad
and my mom were killed...

00:20:18.383 --> 00:20:20.442
...the scene in the apartment
complex...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:22.809
What's wrong?

00:20:35.901 --> 00:20:37.198
What are those!?

00:20:37.236 --> 00:20:39.363
Damn it, what are you doing!?

00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:42.840
Fire! Don't just scare them!
Aim for their vitals!

00:20:49.881 --> 00:20:51.678
T-They're not hurt!

00:20:51.717 --> 00:20:52.809
That can't be!

00:21:03.662 --> 00:21:06.631
There's something... It looks like
faces all over their bodies...

00:21:06.665 --> 00:21:08.599
What in the world
are these things?

00:21:09.935 --> 00:21:11.368
Fire!

00:21:13.572 --> 00:21:14.732
We did it!

00:21:17.342 --> 00:21:18.673
I can smell it...

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.405
The smell of blood!

00:21:20.445 --> 00:21:21.013
Which one of you is the survivor?

00:21:21.013 --> 00:21:21.713
Smell of blood, smell of blood...
Which one of you is the survivor?

00:21:21.713 --> 00:21:22.381
Smell of blood, smell of blood...
You smell like them...

00:21:22.381 --> 00:21:23.609
The smell of impurity...
You smell like them...

00:21:23.649 --> 00:21:25.412
Survivor...

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.218
The smell of a traitor...

00:21:26.218 --> 00:21:28.186
The smell of a traitor...
Damn it, it's messing with us.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.848
Hey, rookies!
Go and call for back up, quick!

00:21:30.889 --> 00:21:32.550
And don't forget the shotguns!

00:21:32.591 --> 00:21:34.024
Y-Yes, sir!

00:21:39.064 --> 00:21:40.053
Shindo!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.368
There, he's the one.

00:21:43.402 --> 00:21:46.462
Kill him.
Kill all of the survivors.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.873
Kill all of the traitors.
Don't leave a single one behind.

00:21:50.909 --> 00:21:55.937
Why are you talking nonsense,
you monster!?

00:21:56.548 --> 00:21:58.379
It's no use...

00:21:58.417 --> 00:22:00.544
No matter how many bullets
you fire at it,

00:22:01.853 --> 00:22:04.447
the people that have been taken over
by them won't die...

00:22:15.701 --> 00:22:18.329
until you cut the faces off
of their bodies.

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.427
I held that hand

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:51.402
And we kissed

00:22:51.436 --> 00:22:56.203
After a little while

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:01.110
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.574
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.220
Sherry, far away

00:23:11.256 --> 00:23:13.656
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:18.595
That I laughed

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.996
Sherry, far away

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:23.432
Sherry, it was you

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:28.098
That I held

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.438
I sung the memories

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:32.966
Forever melodies

00:23:33.011 --> 00:23:35.241
I sung the memories

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:40.315
I sung the memories

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:42.843
Forever melodies

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.083
I sung the memories

00:23:48.126 --> 00:23:50.356
Sherry, far away

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.897
Sherry, far away

00:23:52.931 --> 00:23:59.962
I know you can find
my melodies

00:24:00.939 --> 00:24:04.643
Next Episode Preview

00:24:04.643 --> 00:24:05.871
Next Episode Preview
I've been waiting for you
this whole time.

00:24:07.245 --> 00:24:08.803
Do you mean that incident?

00:24:08.847 --> 00:24:10.178
How do you know about that?

00:24:11.216 --> 00:24:13.116
Ranmaru Shindo.

00:24:14.052 --> 00:24:16.680
But this is simply the beginning.

00:24:19.925 --> 00:24:22.519
On the next episode of Tokko,

00:24:22.994 --> 00:24:24.484
"Dream".

00:24:25.964 --> 00:24:30.901
Dream
